    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "GPT-5.6 Sol on wolfram2002-ch09-18: needs-new-data, resolvability 0.31";
    dc:description "Causal invariance is decidable for some proposed rules, but the claim concerns the unknown rule of the universe. Existing observations lack the resolution and model specificity needed to identify that property.";
