    dc:type "resolution-route/mixed";
    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Specify candidate fundamental rewrite rules and compare predictions generated under different update orders with observations of spacetime and particle physics. Evidence for order-dependent observable histories would refute causal invariance; a uniquely successful invariant rule would support it.";
    prov:wasAttributedTo <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/agent/delphisci-resolvability-assessor-gpt-5.6-sol-medium>;
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/assessmentType> "dataset-resolvability/0.2.0";
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/ontology/evidenceAgainst> "Current data do not reveal microscopic update order.", "Many causally invariant rules may be observationally equivalent.", "The actual rule is unknown.";
